{"at": "2026-09-18T03:05:01.321609+00:00", "pr": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/507", "id": 4484554604, "node_id": "PR_kwDOUJyJf88AAAABC0zfbA", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/507", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/507.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/507.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/507", "number": 507, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "pr_train.py: merge train for ready PRs (one build, one CI, fast-forward main)", "user": {"login": "Dengnifer", "id": 89234078, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "### Motivation\n- Address #502 by validating and transporting a batch of reviewed PRs with\n  one combined integration build, avoiding repeated updates and builds\n  after each individual merge.\n\n### Description\n- Add a model-free merge train that verifies member review evidence and\n  integration gates, records the batch manifest and outcomes, and retains\n  the leased atomic push.\n- Implement the owner-authorized contract of 2026-09-18: claim every member\n  before manifest verification and hold the claims through transport;\n  immediately re-read every member ref after a successful push. Record\n  moved refs and claim-list evidence as contract violations, and withhold\n  the tooling's merged mark for those members. Later member commits are\n  absent from main.\n- State the accepted advertisement-to-commit window explicitly in the\n  protocol and dated EVOLUTION amendment. This contract requires no\n  server-side predicate for unchanged member refs. Ordinary single-PR\n  merges retain their existing path.\n\n### Testing\n- Exact-head CI passed all nine contexts in392 seconds on `6122bb19`.\n- Fresh independent review5243821755 inspected the full main-relative\n  change and ran six claim, transport, cleanup and moved-member fixtures,\n  all passing in24 seconds. It returned CHANGES_REQUESTED for a duplicate\n  empty incident-log heading and the head commit's overlong subject.\n- The reviewer did not run the three real-project fixtures or a live\n  GitHub train. The remaining findings require a bounded repair and\n  independent recheck before merge.\n\n---\nCloses #502\n", "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:51:54Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T03:04:59Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "7ce6f6702a23386e77b4eb4a64da8d108c142293", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 12025011061, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8bdQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/infrastructure", "name": "infrastructure", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Fo